  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - This permission shall have the effect of varying condition numbered 2 on planning permission reference P/2771/15 (allowed on appeal APP/M5450/W/16/3160432) dated 11/1/17:\n\nThe development hereby permitted shall be carried out, completed and retained in accordance with the following approved plans:\n020; 021; 022; 023; 024; 025; 026; 027; 028; 029A; 030A; 108; 110, 111; Cover Letter, Barton Willmore (Dated 4/01/2022)\nREASON: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning",
    "Condition : 2 - This permission shall have the effect of varying condition numbered 3 on planning permission reference P/2771/15 (allowed on appeal APP/M5450/W/16/3160432) dated 11/1/17:\nPrior to the first occupation of the development hereby permitted, details regarding servicing and refuse collection shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details. \n\nReason: To ensure waste and refuse servicing and collection are adequate to serve the development",
    "Condition : 3 - This permission shall have the effect of varying condition numbered 4 on planning permission reference P/2771/15 (allowed on appeal APP/M5450/W/16/3160432) dated 11/1/17:\n\nPrior to installation, a schedule of materials and specifications to be used in the construction of \nthe external surfaces, \nwindows and doors \nof the extension hereby permitted shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. Samples shall be made available on site for inspection. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved materials and details. \n\nReason: To ensure a high-quality finish is achieved and the finished development respects the appearance of the Harrow Town Centre. "
  ],
